icloud-for-linux (0.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rust rewrite of the iCloud Drive FUSE filesystem, licensed under
    GPL-3.0-only.
  * Local-first core: content addressed store, lazy path index, write ahead
    journal.
  * Apple protocol client: SRP sign in, two factor authentication, drive
    service.
  * Background hydration, on demand sync over SIGUSR1, conflict export.

 -- Alessio <alessio@linux.com>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
